-benchmark"},"tags":[{"id":27,"name":"AI评测","slug":"ai-benchmark"},{"id":29,"name":"DeepSeek","slug":"deepseek"},{"id":28,"name":"GLM-5.2","slug":"glm-52"},{"id":30,"name":"Kimi","slug":"kimi"},{"id":31,"name":"Seedance","slug":"seedance"},{"id":26,"name":"国产大模型","slug":"chinese-llm"},{"id":32,"name":"模型对比","slug":"model-comparison"}],"created_at":"2026-07-05T14:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-09-20T19:00:53.624465+08:00","reading_time":14,"views_count":36,"likes_count":1,"is_top":false},{"slug":"how-to-choose-ai-coding-tools","title":"AI 编程工具怎么选？主流工具全面对比与选型","excerpt":"引言：AI 编程工具的\"百家争鸣\" 2024 年以来，AI 编程工具进入了爆发期。从 GitHub Copilot 的一家独大，到如今 Claude Code、Cursor、Windsurf、Aider 等工具百花齐放——开发者面临的已经不是\"用不用 AI\"，而是\" 选哪个 AI \"。 这篇文章将从实际开发体验出发，帮","cover_image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555066931-4365d14bab8c?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop","category":{"id":5,"name":"AI编程","slug":"ai-coding"},"tags":[{"id":21,"name":"AI编程","slug":"ai-coding"},{"id":18,"name":"Claude Code","slug":"claude-code"},{"id":22,"name":"Cursor","slug":"cursor"},{"id":23,"name":"GitHub Copilot","slug":"github-copilot"},{"id":24,"name":"开发工具","slug":"dev-tools"},{"id":25,"name":"效率","slug":"productivity"}],"created_at":"2026-07-05T10:00:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-09-20T19:01:28.460469+08:00","reading_time":8,"views_count":28,"likes_count":0,"is_top":false},{"slug":"test-manage-system-vue-django","title":"从零搭建测试管理系统：Vue 3 + Django 全栈实战","excerpt":"从零搭建测试管理系统：Vue 3 + Django 全栈实战 前言 在软件开发中，测试是保证质量的关键环节。但很多团队还在用 Excel 管理测试用例、用微信群同步缺陷——效率低不说，还容易遗漏和出错。 今天要介绍的 测试管理系统（Test Management System） 就是一个专为 QA 团队打造的全栈平台。","cover_image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1200&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop","category":{"id":1,"name":"技术教程","slug":"tech"},"tags":[{"id":17,"name":"DRF","slug":"drf"},{"id":2,"name":"Django","slug":"django"},{"id":15,"name":"Element Plus","slug":"element-plus"},{"id":16,"name":"PostgreSQL","slug":"postgresql"},{"id":1,"name":"Vue.js","slug":"vue"},{"id":14,"nam